OL,3,GNEWSACompany fined after worker dies in
OL,4,Afirst-floor fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA carpenter carrying out refurbishment
OL,7,Fwork died when he fell through a floor
OL,8,Fbecause safety measures had not been
OL,9,Fput in place, an investigation has
OL,10,Ffound.
OL,12,FW G Carter Limited, of Appleton,
OL,13,FOxfordshire, was fined #120,000 after
OL,14,Fthe death of Richard "Felix" Roper, who
OL,15,Ffell at a domestic property in
OL,16,FGloucestershire.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
