OL,3,GNEWSACompany fined after worker dies in
OL,4,Afirst-floor fall
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation by the Health and
OL,7,FSafety Executive (HSE) and
OL,8,FGloucestershire Police found the work
OL,9,Fhad not been properly planned,
OL,10,Fappropriately supervised, or carried
OL,11,Fout safely.
OL,13,FHSE principal inspector James Lucas
OL,14,Fsaid: "Due to the failings of this
OL,15,Fcompany, a man lost his life." The
OL,16,Fcompany described it as a "tragic
OL,17,Faccident that should not have
OL,18,Fhappened".
